{"type": "system", "id": "2939bb50-839f-4d80-9169-5ab5657f989a", "ts": "2026-01-23T09:26:00Z", "text": "The hazy driftwood reaches past the nimble dune."}
{"type": "system", "id": "8dc7b1b7-f484-488d-8b57-214b4bc3d5f2", "ts": "2026-01-23T09:27:46Z", "text": "The dune mirrors beside the willow, and the clover crosses."}
{"type": "user", "id": "50e6e255-5c9a-401e-8b7f-73912d0728f4", "ts": "2026-01-23T09:41:43Z", "text": "The rustic cedar crosses past the rustic summit."}
